        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-25T18:13:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CONFIG_ACCEL_FIFO is for the entire motionsense stack and not a per-sensor FIFO, correct?",
      "revId": "1fa868e1980e19bb680801ac9393b7cdf95c8cab",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5ccd5fce_f4f995e1",
        "filename": "board/cave/board.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 555,
      "author": {
        "id": 1186109
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-26T01:37:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct, fifo_max_event_count represents maximum number of the sensor\u0027s events that could exist in the FIFO (if all other sensors were disabled).  By definition, fiffo_max_event_count refers to common fifo space that is potentially shared with other sensors.  Android sensor services also wants to know reserved space fifo size, if any, but the EC does not support reserved FIFOs for the sensors, so the sensor HAL will report reserved FIFO size as 0.",
      "parentUuid": "0f7c7fdd_b8f53cdd",
      "revId": "1fa868e1980e19bb680801ac9393b7cdf95c8cab",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1b78ad40_a804736c",
        "filename": "board/cave/board.c",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 555,
      "author": {
        "id": 1125984
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-26T02:35:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not yet clear to me how/where this information will be queried. But if it\u0027s just the FIFO count for the entire motionsense stack, I don\u0027t think it makes sense to define this attribute per-sensor. This attribute seems to be more suited for reserved FIFOs.\n\nWhat if we just returned CONFIG_ACCEL_FIFO when queried (if defined)? Maybe it will become clearer with other patches.",
      "parentUuid": "5ccd5fce_f4f995e1",
      "revId": "1fa868e1980e19bb680801ac9393b7cdf95c8cab",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
